@startuml 10-state-connection
title Connection lifecycle of the printer
[*] --> Disconnected

Disconnected --> MacLookup : connect()
MacLookup --> Disconnected : no MAC found\n("No printer found")

MacLookup --> Connecting : MAC known
Connecting --> Connected : RFCOMM channel 1 open
Connecting --> Waiting : OSError
Waiting --> Connecting : retry (3x, 2 s pause)
Waiting --> Disconnected : all attempts failed

Connected --> Sending : print_image() / feed()
Sending --> Connected : frame sent\n(432 byte blocks, no pauses)
Sending --> Connected : timeout (0.8 s read window)
Connected --> Disconnected : close() / context manager ends

state Connected {
  [*] --> Ready
  Ready --> Initialised : 0x80 token
  Initialised --> Configured : 0x0a speed, 0x09 density
  Configured --> Ready : 0x02 feed
}
@enduml
